    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "Arrange these numbers in increasing order.\n\n$-\\dfrac98,\\ \\dfrac{12}8,\\ 0.2,\\ -0.02,\\ -\\dfrac79,\\ \\dfrac1{0.4}$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-\\dfrac98<-\\dfrac79<-0.02<0.2<\\dfrac{12}8<\\dfrac1{0.4}$",
      "worked": "$\\begin{align*}-\\frac98&=-1.125\\\\-\\frac79&=-0.777\\ldots\\\\\\frac{12}8&=1.5\\\\\\frac1{0.4}&=2.5\\end{align*}$\n\nHence, in increasing order:\n\n$-\\dfrac98<-\\dfrac79<-0.02<0.2<\\dfrac{12}8<\\dfrac1{0.4}$",
